# Bumpers: from the boardwalk to the cabinet; the test player steers at the nearest car (bumps score), then at the
# next note up (runs and chords: combos); sixty seconds and it is over, the best kept; PLAY stops a session
wait 800
turn SELECT 9
wait 400
expect cab 9
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect game 10
expect bumpers_state 0
shot stand.png
autobumpers on
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect bumpers_state 1
wait 8000
shot play.png
expect bumpers_bumps >2
autobumpers tune
wait 30000
shot tune.png
expect bumpers_combos >0
wait 22500
expect bumpers_state 2
expect bumpers_score >10
expect bumpers_best >10
shot over.png
autobumpers off
turn K1 2
wait 100
expect bumpers_level 3
shot stand3.png
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect bumpers_state 1
key w0 down
wait 600
expect bumpers_steer 0
key w0 up
tapkey b3
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect bumpers_state 0
shot stopped.png
